# Environment configuration for Maya AI.
# Gemini AI calls use Firebase AI Logic (App Check attested; no GEMINI_API_KEY required).
# Optional third-party provider keys (OpenAI, Groq, DeepSeek, Together, NVIDIA NIM, Anthropic, OpenRouter, Deepgram, SerpAPI)
# can be configured by the user securely inside the app (stored via Android Keystore / EncryptedSharedPreferences).
